{
  "case_id": "CMDSURF-1.20.1",
  "title": "命令面闸门(1.20.1)：把测试套件用到的 9 条命令逐条送进服务端 dispatcher **只解析不执行**，断言全部 ok=1。守住「版本相关命令写死在用例里」这一隐患 —— 26.1.2 起全部 gamerule 改名(snake_case)，旧名会被整条拒绝且静默 no-op。",
  "version": "1.20.1",
  "target": {
    "type": "env",
    "ref": "command_surface"
  },
  "on_fail": "keep_game_running",
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "目的：**命令面闸门**。把本测试套件用到的每一条原版命令送进服务端 dispatcher **只解析、不执行**，逐条断言 `AP_CS<k>_CMDCHECK:ok=1`。\n\n动机（实测踩过）：26.1.2 起 Mojang 把**全部 gamerule 改名**（camelCase + do 前缀 → snake_case）：\n  naturalRegeneration -> natural_health_regeneration；doMobSpawning -> spawn_mobs。\n用例里写死的旧名会被服务器**整条拒绝、命令不执行**（回显「错误的命令参数」/「Incorrect argument for command」），而注入器只负责按键、断言只看探针读数 ⇒ 三条用例照样 PASS，缺陷**完全静默**。\n\n机制：探针 `cmdcheck <tag> <原始命令>` 在服务端 `dispatcher.parse(...)`（无副作用），落\n  AP_<tag>_CMDCHECK:ok=1:cmd=...            本版本接受\n  AP_<tag>_CMDCHECK:ok=0:cmd=...:err=...    本版本拒绝（err = brigadier 英文原文，不本地化）\n\n兜底：另断言 `<--\\[` 不出现。MC 对被拒命令的回显恒为「<本地化文案>」+「<命令原文><--[HERE]」（中文 `<--[此处]`）——`<--[` 前缀与语言无关，且干净运行中 0 次出现（三线快照日志实测），故任何被拒的注入命令都会让本用例响亮失败。\n\n⚠️ 负对照（`CSX`）：额外送一条**另一版本**的 gamerule 写法，断言它**必须** ok=0。没有这一步，「闸门全绿」就无法排除「cmdcheck 恒返回 ok=1」这种自证式假绿。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamemode survival",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe cmdcheck CS1 gamemode survival",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe cmdcheck CS2 gamerule naturalRegeneration false",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe cmdcheck CS3 gamerule doMobSpawning false",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe cmdcheck CS4 kill @e[type=!player,distance=..128]",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe cmdcheck CS5 tp @s ~ ~ ~ 0 0",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe cmdcheck CS6 clear @s",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe cmdcheck CS7 give @s astral_dice:effect_card_hamburger 1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe cmdcheck CS8 gamerule doMobSpawning true",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe cmdcheck CS9 astralprobe megasread AA BB",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe cmdcheck CSX gamerule natural_health_regeneration false",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    }
  ],
